  "description": "The Rhythm Pro complete jump bike is ready to roll with everything you need to start sessioning at the local trails, skateparks and pump tracks. Let’s talk about materials. At DMR we are known for our steel hardtails, like the Sect dirt jump frame. But we never rest on our laurels, so we've created this, the best aluminium dirt jump bike available.\nThe Rhythm frameset that is the heart of this dirt bike uses tubes made from 6061 T6 aluminium alloy. The lightness and stiffness of this tubing make it ideal for a frame that holds its own equally at the trails and the 4X track.\nDetails on the frame include a tapered headtube, machined chainstay yoke and interchangeable dropouts – these integrated sliding dropouts make adjusting chain tension a breeze. Dropouts are also interchangeable with our Rhythm gear-compatible dropouts if you want to change your setup later down the line.\nThe excellent X-Fusion Slant RC Air Fork handles suspension duties on this Pro model. Thanks to the air spring, this dirt jump specific fork is strong, lightweight, and super adjustable. Tool-free rebound and compression damping adjustment make it super-easy to dial in your ride.\nThe rest of the components are carefully selected with performance and strength in mind. Highlights include a DMR cockpit featuring butted aluminium DMR handlebars, Sect DJ grips and a short stem. We've also specced our own, proven DMR Moto DJ Tyres and Tektro Hydraulic brakes on the front and rear.\nReady to hit the trails? Then look no further.",
